{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stop — keep completed edits\n\nD-067 · Automatic restoration deferred.\nCancel/settle work; preserve current files.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]\n[[Things to Optimize]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "distinctions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Three events, retained edits\n\nFailed edit: preserve earlier successful edits.\nStop: cancel remaining work; keep edits.\nSteering: continue the same run with new guidance.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "scope",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Restoration is later work\n\nNo automatic inverse patch or Git reset.\nNo full before-file journal solely for undo.\nKeep edit conflict checks and visible changes.\n\n[[Deferred File Restoration]]",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "stop",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · User presses Stop\n\nPersist the stopping state.\nBlock new requests, tool actions and pending approvals for this run.\nNo extra confirmation.\nShow Stopping.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Cancel active work\n\nCancel generation and owned tools where possible.\nReject late calls/output.\nA cancelled model request does not prove a file write has stopped.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "settle",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Settle writers\n\nCancel/settle owned processes and writes.\nDetermine actual outcomes.\nRetain project reservation during cleanup.\nKnown retained edits do not require rollback.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "restore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Keep current files\n\nLeave completed and known partial edits in place.\nSave actual execution/change outcomes.\nNo automatic restoration runs.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "verify",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Refresh the result\n\nUpdate visible changes and +/− counts.\nRetain partial chat/tool history.\nReport actual outcomes and uncertainty.\nDo not claim files were restored.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stopped — completed changes kept\n\nWriters and outcomes are settled.\nEnd the run and release its project reservation.\nUser may review edits and start new work.",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "record",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Change/outcome records\n\nTrack tools, actual changes and diffs.\nKeep records needed for unknown outcomes.\nAutomatic undo snapshots/journal are deferred.\n\n[[Deferred File Restoration]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "queue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Genuinely unknown outcome\n\nRetain outcome information.\nBlock affected writes until uncertainty resolves.\nRead-only inspection may continue.\nKnown retained edits alone do not block work.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_only",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Text / read-only work\n\nSettle cancellation, retain partial conversation and mark stopped.\nThe same Stop principle applies to coding work: keep completed effects.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "conflict",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Another writer changed a file\n\nDo not overwrite it.\nFresh-read/revision checks still apply.\nStop leaves the current version in place.\nNo automatic merge or restoration.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stopped — needs attention\n\nA writer/action outcome remains unknown.\nShow actual partial changes and uncertainty.\nKeep relevant records and affected write blocks.\nThis is not deferred rollback recovery.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "fromNode": "stop",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "cancel",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "fromNode": "cancel",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "settle",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "fromNode": "settle",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "restore",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Tracked repository edits"
    },
    {
      "id": "q4",
      "fromNode": "restore",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "verify",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Current edits retained"
    },
    {
      "id": "q5",
      "fromNode": "verify",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "done",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Outcomes settled"
    },
    {
      "id": "q6",
      "fromNode": "settle",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "text_only",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "No edits"
    },
    {
      "id": "q7",
      "fromNode": "restore",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "conflict",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Concurrent edit observed",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8",
      "fromNode": "conflict",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "attention",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Preserve current file",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "q9",
      "fromNode": "verify",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "attention",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Outcome still unknown",
      "color": "1"
    }
  ]
}
